WEBVTT

00:02.920 --> 00:03.600
Your Majesty.

00:03.760 --> 00:05.160
General Zu has arrived.

00:06.880 --> 00:11.480
Alright that's enough discussion for today go practice horsemanship.

00:11.920 --> 00:13.320
Yes, Father.

00:15.360 --> 00:16.760
Yu'er.

00:17.440 --> 00:20.400
How about having Fan Zhong take you to catch rabbits?

00:20.480 --> 00:21.880
Great.

00:24.120 --> 00:28.680
Father before meeting the general better wipe your hands clean first.

00:30.240 --> 00:31.640
Good.

00:41.320 --> 00:47.160
Back then Your Majesty gave Shilang several hundred sets of armor never expected he could use just that.

00:47.240 --> 00:52.520
To kill Ayidai and seize power now shilang has swept the north established the Wei state.

00:52.680 --> 00:54.440
Wuzhao tribes have also submitted.

00:55.320 --> 00:59.760
Scouts report they are training troops perhaps before long.

01:00.120 --> 01:02.453
They will attack us from the south.

01:03.640 --> 01:06.200
Your Majesty we must prepare early.

01:08.800 --> 01:10.760
Shilang is waiting for an opportunity.

01:12.320 --> 01:13.800
I am also waiting.

01:18.320 --> 01:23.720
By the way Your daughter since she's betrothed to Sheng'er let her come to the palace to visit.

01:23.800 --> 01:25.467
Nandu's feng shui nurtures people.

01:26.440 --> 01:29.800
Of course move aside, quickly move aside.

01:32.200 --> 01:36.280
Your Majesty be careful Your Majesty, be careful.

01:38.240 --> 01:41.480
The startled horse is out of control Your son deserves death Your son deserves death where is the stable master?

01:41.560 --> 01:43.040
Where is the stable master?

01:43.120 --> 01:45.120
How was this mad horse selected?

01:47.120 --> 01:52.760
Your Majesty the startled horse is out of control is definitely not the crown prince's fault I request the stable master be executed immediately.

